# Release and Change Management

- Use phased rollout for high-risk capabilities (canary, ring, or cohort).
- Define explicit go/no-go criteria and rollback triggers.
- Ensure change communications and stakeholder sign-offs are complete.
- Freeze risky changes during cutover windows unless exception approved.
